Subject: [PATCH 36/41] tracker 0.9.0: report sealing v2 (a 3 B commitment to
 the mailbox key pk_n in every report, one public key per sealed copy;
 selftest pk_us; CONFIG_LIBRETAG_NOSTR required)

---
 zephcore/src/lt_version.h     |  2 +-
 zephcore/src/main_tracker.cpp | 49 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 2 files changed, 46 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/zephcore/src/lt_version.h b/zephcore/src/lt_version.h
index fd3f0bc..140a778 100644
--- a/zephcore/src/lt_version.h
+++ b/zephcore/src/lt_version.h
